  (text "RP2350 (R85): MIDI DIN 2 in / 4 out, TRS 1 in / 2 out (A/B in firmware), 8 CV/Gate +-10 V (2 x DAC80504), 4 CV in, sync 3 out / 2 in; USB2514B hub: up = Mini-ITX, down = RP2350, panel P2, A1 port A, spare" (at 25.4 15.24 0)
